    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1115">

                <pb facs="0930" n="814" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg814"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.113/572.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            American Consul at Chihuahua</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-06-05">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 5, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department approves your course, notwithstanding rebels’ failure to heed your
                    representations. Instructions already sent you believed sufficient.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Knox.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
